      "comment": "Velimiru: Zhuoxin's blackmail",
      "content": "Zhuoxin is a Liyue merchant whose wife Aamu and daughter Adieta were with him near the Flower-Feather Clan. According to the Fatui he owed money to the Northland Bank and was forced to bring Ineffa to Natlan, and then to the temple, under threat to his family. In Searing, Velimiru handed him a replica control device to use against the Eleventh Lord, and when he refused, abandoned him.\n\nThe Fatui offered to write off his debt and let him return to Liyue, and Fajeyi reminded him that the contract had a termination clause.",
