        "Natlan"
      ],
      "comment": "Velimiru: Sandrone's special-ops team",
      "content": "Sandrone (called Marionette by her creation), a Fatui Harbinger, assigned this team to search for knowledge of ancient civilisations for an unrevealed purpose. When they proposed going to Natlan, she warned them of the danger and of the Traveler as an unpredictable variable, but did not forbid it. Velimiru repeats her phrase as he dies.",
