    "3": {
      "uid": 3,
      "key": [
        "Mirror of the Dawning Morn",
        "Eleventh Lord",
        "Eleventh Sovereign Lord"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Velimiru",
        "Ch'upikaq Tajin"
      ],
      "comment": "Velimiru: The Eleventh Sovereign Lord",
      "content": "The Eleventh Lord, Ix Raq'lapuj Chue'q Buluk, is one of the Thirteen Sovereign Lords, dragon-era artificial intelligences. In Searing it appears in the temple's core as the Mirror of the Dawning Morn and crushes Fajeyi and Gulebu, badly wounding Velimiru. When it is damaged, Velimiru reignites it with his controller as a last gamble, and it speaks of burying everyone in the ruins. Citlali had earlier suspected Ineffa's core might be this Lord's; his scenes do not confirm that.",
